# ── POST-DEPLOY ──
# The engine ships unbound and is wired in the same broadcast (setFeeds / setParams / setPool /
# transferOwnership to ENGINE_ADMIN); a fresh engine is required because the pool ctor demands a
# reciprocal binding and CollateralEngine.setPool is one-shot.
# Off-chain cutover (pool address, chain binding, reflection genesis height) is tracked in ops.
